tps://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":1},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.beta2 and later\n- Not reproducible in 4.7.beta1 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta2.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9174) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads) - 63.74 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nLikely related: [#118651](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118651)\n\nThere seems to be situations where adding a Control sibling to a Label node with some form of auto-wrapping enabled can cause a crash. It is unclear what the specific set of conditions is to trigger the crash, but it seems to be directly related to auto-wrapping and being a descendant of a node with a maximum size.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new scene containing a BoxContainer\n- Add a VBoxContainer child to the BoxContainer with Custom Maximum Size set to (100, 100)\n- Add a Control child to the VBoxContainer with its vertical size flags set to expand and fill\n- Add an HBoxContainer child to the VBoxContainer \n- Add a Control child to the HBoxContainer\n- Add a Label child to the HBoxContainer with autowrap set to Arbitrary\n- Give the label text long enough to wrap it to a second line\n- Add a control sibling for the Label\n- Crash\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[label_crash_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28733188/label_crash_mrp.zip)\n\nAdding a new control node to the HBoxContainer named PARENT will trigger a crash.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120099/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120099/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}